page='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Scooby cave preproduction map</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101e1b;color:#eee;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1536px;margin:auto}svg{width:100%;height:auto}button{margin:5px;padding:10px;background:#315947;color:white;border:1px solid #8ab482;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}section{padding:12px 5%;line-height:1.6}li{margin-bottom:12px}code{color:#ffe59a}h1{font-size:22px}</style><main>'''+''.join(svg)+'''<section><h1>Routes and fixed chamber descriptions</h1><p>Planning diagram: illustration-led authored geography, not a recovered measured site. Select a day to inspect its journey. The mother/infant station and the scout group are distinguished in the production script.</p><div id="buttons"></div><p id="routeText"></p><ul>'''+''.join(f'<li><strong>{n["id"]} — {n["name"]}</strong>: {n["features"]} {n.get("landmark","")}</li>' for n in nodes)+'''</ul><p>Two shallow branches at C4 reunite in C5. The dry walking route stays on a broad bank. Skylights and luminous berry vines are the named light sources. Flowers and moss form readable islands; clear silhouettes and quiet resting spaces remain.</p></section></main><script>const plan='''+json.dumps(plan)+''';const byId=Object.fromEntries(plan.nodes.map(n=>[n.id,n]));const xy=p=>[110+(p[0]+28)*8,110+p[1]*5.5];for(const [day,route] of Object.entries(plan.dayRoutes)){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent='Day '+day;b.onclick=()=>{const layer=document.querySelector('#routeLayer');layer.replaceChildren();const line=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','polyline');line.setAttribute('points',route.map(id=>xy(byId[id].centre).join(',')).join(' '));line.setAttribute('fill','none');line.setAttribute('stroke','#fff');line.setAttribute('stroke-width','4');line.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray','9 7');line.setAttribute('opacity','.85');layer.append(line);document.querySelector('#routeText').textContent='Day '+day+': '+route.join(' → ')};document.querySelector('#buttons').append(b)}const clear=document.createElement('button');clear.textContent='Clear route';clear.onclick=()=>{document.querySelector('#routeLayer').replaceChildren();document.querySelector('#routeText').textContent=''};document.querySelector('#buttons').append(clear);</script></html>'''
